	(gr_text "Signals routed on Signal_Top(Horizontal) and Signal_Bottom(vertical)\nsignals (from sensors, driving actuators and ui) -> use default net class\n12V power lines are to be routed on the top layer -> use the Power_HV net class\n\nLayer 2 is the ground layer, cover it in clean ground and where the 12V\nactuators are placed, put dirty ground, connect the two grounds using \nthe net tie\n\nLayer 3 routes power i.e. 3.3V and 5V. -> use Power_Logic netclass\n\n"
		(at 5.1 -38.5 0)
